# WS-78 — MediaItem coded error wiring (45 codes)

**Target repo:** `magiq-media`
**Depends on:** MM-100 (SDK `errorCode` slot), MM-032 (`AggregateAlreadyExistsException` → `MediaItemIdAlreadyExists`)

## Problem

`docs/spec/shared/error-catalog.md § MediaItem` names 45 codes — the largest aggregate in the catalog. Code emits every MediaItem refusal as `DomainError.InvalidOperation(prose)` with no `errorCode` member on the wire. `MediaItemErrorCodes` constants class is unbuilt.

## Codes (45)

**Identity + state (4):** `MediaItemNotFound` (404), `MediaItemAlreadyExists` (409), `MediaItemIdAlreadyExists` (409), `NotResourceOwner` (403).

**Checkout + edit-session (6):** `MediaItemCheckedOut` (422/403), `MediaItemNotCheckedOut` (422), `CheckoutLeaseExpired` (422), `CheckoutNotLeased` (422), `MediaItemNotCheckoutable` (422), `TooManyCollaborators` (400).

**Lifecycle (6):** `MediaItemAlreadyArchived` (422), `MediaItemArchived` (422), `MediaItemNotArchived` (422), `MediaItemAlreadyDeleted` (422), `MediaItemNotEditable` (422), `MediaItemAssetsNotReleasable` (422).

**Retention + legal hold (8):** `MediaItemUnderLegalHold` (422), `MediaItemRetentionActive` (422), `MediaItemRetainedPermanently` (422), `LegalHoldAlreadyPlaced` (409), `LegalHoldNotFound` (404), `RetentionAlreadyStarted` (422), `MediaItemHasActiveRegistrations` (422), `RetentionScheduleNotPinnable` (422).

**Supersession + finalization (3):** `InvalidSupersession` (422), `MediaItemAlreadySuperseded` (422), `MediaItemAlreadyFinalized` (422).

**External event + disposition review (4):** `ExternalEventNotAdmitted` (422), `ExternalEventAlreadyPinned` (422), `ExternalEventPayloadInvalid` (400), `DispositionReviewNotAdmitted` (422).

**Review (6):** `NotAssignedReviewer` (403), `ReviewerAlreadyDecided` (422), `MinimumReviewersRequired` (422), `ReviewerIsInitiator` (422), `ReviewInProgress` (422), `MissingTextAlternative` (422).

**Change request (3):** `ChangeRequestRequired` (422), `ChangeRequestNotOpen` (422), `ChangeRequestItemMismatch` (422).

**Role + publish (2):** `RoleAssignmentNotFound` (404), `MissingTextAlternative` (already listed).

**Metadata (4):** `MetadataValidationFailed` (422), `MetadataFieldValueTooLarge` (422), `MetadataFieldCountExceeded` (422), `MetadataPayloadTooLarge` (422).

(Spec text may re-use `MediaItemArchived` across Asset + MediaItem contexts — handled per aggregate ownership.)

## Code state today

- `MediaItem.cs` + handlers return `DomainError.InvalidOperation(prose)` / `ResourceNotFound(prose)` across every refusal site. No `errorCode`.
- Many codes gated on commands/flows that may be partially built:
  - Retention + legal hold: entity-level state may need snapshot additions.
  - Supersession + finalization: distinct lifecycle extensions.
  - External event + disposition review: pin-driven lifecycle.
- `MediaItemErrorCodes` constants class is unbuilt.
- `MediaItemIdAlreadyExists` depends on F020 / MM-032.
- `NotAssignedReviewer` / `ReviewerAlreadyDecided` must be aggregate-invariant refusals (CLAUDE.md § Auth), not handler-side.

## What the spec requires

- `MediaItemErrorCodes` constants class with 45 members.
- Every `MediaItem.*` method refusal returns `DomainError.<factory>(errorCode: MediaItemErrorCodes.<code>, …)`.
- Every operation-named handler under `Catalog.WriteModel/Commands/MediaItems/**/*Handler.cs` (28 built handlers: `CreateMediaItem`, `ApproveReview`, `RejectReview`, `AssignAssetToRole`, `UnassignAssetFromRole`, `ReplaceAssetInRole`, `AssignMediaItemToFolder`, `MoveMediaItem`, `ArchiveMediaItem`, `DeleteMediaItem`, `BeginRevision`, `DiscardRevision`, `PublishMediaItem`, `RejectMediaItem`, `WithdrawMediaItem`, `TagMediaItem`, `SetMetadataField`, `SetMetadataBatch`, `BulkSetMetadata`, `BulkCreateMediaItems`, `UpdateMediaItemTitle`, `UpdateMediaItemDescription`, `UpdateConformanceStatus`, `AddRegistrationRef`, `RemoveRegistrationRef`, `LinkSigningSession`, `UnlinkSigningSession`, `PurgeMediaItemVersion`) reports `errorCode` on refusals + aggregate-missing (`MediaItemNotFound`), name-reservation (`MediaItemAlreadyExists`), duplicate-id (`MediaItemIdAlreadyExists` via MM-032), resource-predicate (`NotResourceOwner`). The 28-handler scope was understated at draft time under the narrow `*MediaItemHandler.cs` glob — handlers in operation-named folders don't match that pattern.
- `MediaItem.ReviewSession` invariants refuse `NotAssignedReviewer` + `ReviewerAlreadyDecided` from the aggregate (not the handler).
- `MetadataValidationFailed` carries `fieldErrors` extension payload per `error-catalog.md § Extension members`.
- Bulk envelope `BulkItemError.ErrorCode` lookup from `MediaItemErrorCodes` for batch flows.

## Scope boundary

- **MediaItem only.** Asset, Collection, Folder, MediaProfile each have their own cells + plans.
- Does not build any missing MediaItem commands/handlers (that is Phase B of MediaItem × write-model). This plan carries constants + wires call sites that exist today. Call sites for codes whose owning commands aren't built yet land as constants only; wiring follows when the commands do.

